Basic unit testing for development

1) load the DriverUnitTesting.fp7 FileMaker database into your FileMaker server

2) install the Case into yourcakeinstall/app/Test

3) define a test database connection that points to the DriverUnitTesting database

Unit testing for the Data API driver (FilemakerDataAPI)

1) host the DriverUnitTesting.fmp12 FileMaker database on FileMaker Server,
   enable the Data API and the "fmrest" extended privilege for the test account

2) place FMDataAPI as yourcakeinstall/app/Vendor/FMDataAPI/src

3) install the Case into yourcakeinstall/app/Test and define a database
   connection named "test_dataapi" with 'datasource' => 'Database/FilemakerDataAPI'
   that points to the DriverUnitTesting database

4) run: Console/cake test app Model/Datasource/Database/FilemakerDataAPI
